## Libra GoB

**What it is:** CP's connection to the Libra GoB gateway (`libra-cpp-gob-gateway.prod.internal.hmcts.net`, 10.23.15.72, HMCTS Interim Hosting).

**Current live path (still on the FTPS VM):** APIM's `CppGatewayService` API (`/debtorprofile`) calls `https://mpdimzftps01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net:8443/`. HAProxy on `MPDIMZFTPS01` forwards it through the VPN and Cloud Gateway (rule `LIVE-CRIME-PXY_IH-P-LIBRA-CPP-VIP`) to 10.23.15.72:443.

**Planned change:**

- GoB is moved to a **real-time API service through APIM**.
- `MPDIMZFTPS01` (the FTPS box) **will be decommissioned soon**.

